# Porter (objects)

When editing under `objects/`, you are implementing **one** handler from `tasks/handlers/0x*.md`.

- Match the source's behavior with typed actors and shared native helpers, per `docs/idiomatic-rust-porting.md`; keep slot bytes in the `compat/` adapter.
- Add `#[test]` with in-memory slot bytes; run `cargo test -p sml2-core`.
- Do not refactor unrelated handlers or read the whole `objects/` tree unless explicitly scoped under `PORTING.md`.

See `hermes/worker-handler.system.md` and `PORTING.md`.
